# Armadillo reaches the same BLAS and LAPACK that R itself uses, so the matrix
# products here are the ones R would have made. Nothing else is set: an
# optimisation or architecture flag would either be redundant with R's own or
# would make the build unreproducible across the platforms CRAN tests on.
PKG_LIBS = $(LAPACK_LIBS) $(BLAS_LIBS) $(FLIBS)
